---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact DriveOps | Sales & Support" description="Talk to DriveOps about trips, dispatch, fleet care and rentals. Contact our team by WhatsApp, email or phone."><main id="main-content"><section class="contact-section"><div class="container contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Let’s talk operations</p><h1>Tell us about the work behind your fleet.</h1><p>What do you run today? Where does the day get complicated? We’ll walk through how DriveOps could fit.</p><div class="contact-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span>Helpful details to share: your fleet size, type of operation, and the workflow you want to improve.</span></div></div><div class="contact-options"><a class="contact-option" href="https://wa.me/919846199883?text=Hello%20DriveOps%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20my%20fleet%20operations."><span class="channel">WHATSAPP</span><h2>Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h2><p>Opens WhatsApp with a message you can review and send.</p></a><a class="contact-option" href="mailto:driveopsfleet@gmail.com?subject=DriveOps%20fleet%20enquiry"><span class="channel">EMAIL</span><h2>Write to our team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h2><p>driveopsfleet@gmail.com</p><small>Opens your email application.</small></a><div class="phone-option"><span class="channel">PHONE</span><h2>Prefer to call?</h2><a href="tel:+919846199883">+91 98461 99883 ↗</a><a href="tel:+919847851049">+91 98478 51049 ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class="location-section"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Based in Kochi, Kerala</span><p>Working with teams that keep fleets moving.</p><a class="text-link" href="/product/">Explore the platform →</a></div></section></main></Base>
<style>.contact-section{padding:var(--section-space) 0;background:var(--paper)}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem}.contact-grid h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,4.2rem);margin:1rem 0 1.5rem}.contact-grid>div>p{color:var(--muted);max-width:470px;font-size:1.05rem}.contact-note{display:flex;gap:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:1.5rem;margin-top:2.5rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;max-width:440px}.contact-note>span:first-child{font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--brand)}.contact-options{display:grid;gap:1rem}.contact-option,.phone-option{display:block;padding:1.75rem;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)}.contact-option:hover{border-color:var(--brand)}.channel{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--brand)}.contact-options h2{font-size:1.35rem;margin:.7rem 0}.contact-options h2 span{float:right;color:var(--brand)}.contact-options p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.contact-options small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem}.phone-option>a{display:inline-block;margin-right:1rem;padding:.4rem 0;color:var(--brand);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}.phone-option>a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.location-section{padding:3rem 0;background:var(--tint)}.location-section p{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:.5rem 0}@media(max-width:750px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.5rem}.contact-note{margin-top:1.5rem}}</style>
